#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:11
msgid "Enable/Disable"
msgstr "Activer/Desactiver"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:12
msgid "Enable Ipaymoney Gateway"
msgstr "Activer Ipaymoney"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:19
msgid "Test Mode"
msgstr "Mode Test"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:20
msgid "Enable Test Mode"
msgstr "Mettre Ipaymoney en Mode Test"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:22
msgid "Sets Ipaymoney into test mode"
msgstr "Cocher cette option pour mettre Ipaymoney en environnement sandbox"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:27
msgid "(Optional) Title"
msgstr "(Optionnel) Titre"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:29
msgid "This controls the title which the user sees during checkout."
msgstr "Définissez un titre Ipaymoney pour vos utilisateurs"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:30
msgid "Pay by Mobile Money and Credit Card (Ipaymoney)"
msgstr "Payez par Mobile Money et par Carte Bancaire (Ipaymoney)"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:34
msgid "(Optional) Description"
msgstr "(Optionnel) Description"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:36
msgid "This controls the description which the user sees during checkout."
msgstr "Définissez une description de Ipaymoney pour vos utilisateurs"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:30
msgid ""
"Use ipaymoney to pay with your Mobile Money account, credit card or bank "
"account"
msgstr ""
"Utilisez Ipaymoney pour payer avec votre compte mobile money, une carte de "
"credit ou un compte bancaire"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:34
msgid "Public KEY"
msgstr "Clé publique"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:37 admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:43
#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:49
msgid "Get your API keys from your Kipaymoney dashboard"
msgstr ""
"Obtenez vos clés d'API sur le dashboard Kipaymoney dans la section "
"<b>Développeurs</b>"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:40
msgid "Private KEY"
msgstr "Clé Privée"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:46
msgid "Secret"
msgstr "Secret"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:52
msgid "(Optional) Widget Position"
msgstr "(Optionnel) Disposition du Widget Ipaymoney"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:54
msgid ""
"When Ipaymoney payment form is displayed directly on your site, you can choose "
"the widget displaying position (left side, right side or center). "
msgstr ""
"Utilisez cette option pour contrôler l'endroit où la fenêtre Ipaymoney devrait "
"s'afficher sur votre site"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:58
msgid "Right Side"
msgstr "Du côté droit de la page"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:59
msgid "Left Side"
msgstr "Du côté gauche de la page"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:60
msgid "Center"
msgstr "Au centre de la page"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:64
msgid "(Optional) Widget Theme"
msgstr "(Optionnel) Thème du widget"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:67
msgid ""
"When Ipaymoney payment form is displayed directly on your site, you can choose "
"the widget color (eg: red) according to your website colors. "
msgstr ""
"Paramétrez la couleur de la fenêtre Ipaymoney. Pour une meilleure "
"harmonisation, utilisez la couleur dominante de votre site ou laissez vide "
"(Recommandée)."

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:70
msgid "(Optional) Add link to your shop logo"
msgstr "(Optionnel) Insérez un lien vers le logo de votre boutique"

#: admin/ipaymoney-settings.php:73
msgid ""
"Enter the URL to a 128x128px image of your brand or product. e.g. "
"<code>https://yoursite.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/09/yourimage.jpg</code>"
msgstr ""
"Entrer l'URL d'une image de taille 128x128px de votre produit ou marque, "
"exemple <code>https://monsite.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/09/monimage.jpg</"
"code>"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:21
msgid ""
"Use ipaymoney to accept payment from Mobile Money account, credit card or bank "
"account"
msgstr ""
"Utilisez Ipaymoney pour payer avec votre compte mobile money, une carte de "
"credit ou un compte bancaire"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:90
msgid ""
"Ipaymoney does not support your store currency. Kindly set it to XOF (FCFA)."
msgstr ""
"Ipaymoney ne supporte pas la devise de votre boutique. Veuillez choisir le "
"FCFA (XOF) comme devise"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:101
msgid "Ipaymoney Payment Gateway Disabled"
msgstr "Ipaymoney est désactivé"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:134
msgid ""
"Thank you for your order, please click the <b>Proceed to payment</b> button "
"below to make payment."
msgstr ""
"Merci pour votre commande, Cliquez sur le bouton <b>Procéder au paiement</b>"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:136
msgid "Cancel order"
msgstr "Annuler la Commande"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:137
msgid "Proceed to payment"
msgstr "Procéder au paiement"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:189
msgid "Payment was successful on Ipaymoney"
msgstr "Paiement réussi sur Ipaymoney"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:191
#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:200
#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:211
msgid "Thank you for your order.<br>"
msgstr "Merci pour votre commande. <br>"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:192
msgid ""
"Your payment was successful, we are now <strong>processing</strong> your "
"order."
msgstr ""
"Votre paiement a été effectué. Nous <strong> sommes en train de traiter </ "
"strong> votre commande."

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:201
#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:212
msgid ""
"Your payment has not been confirmed yet, so we have to put your order "
"<strong>on-hold</strong> "
msgstr ""
"Votre paiement n'a pas encore été confirmé! Votre commande est donc en "
"attente de validation "

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:202
#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:213
msgid ""
"If this persists, Please, contact us for information regarding this order."
msgstr ""
"Si cela persiste, veuillez nous contacter pour obtenir de l'aide sur cette "
"commande."

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:214
msgid ""
"Attention: New order has been placed on hold because of incorrect payment "
"amount or currency. Please, look into it. <br>"
msgstr ""
"Attention: Une nouvelle commande à été mise en attente suite à un paiement "
"incorrect"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:215
msgid "Amount paid: "
msgstr "Montant payé:"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:236
msgid "The order payment failed on Ipaymoney"
msgstr "Le paiement de la commande a échoué sur Ipaymoney"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:237
msgid "Your payment <strong>failed</strong>. "
msgstr "Votre <strong> paiement a échoué </ strong>."

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:238
msgid "Please, try funding your account."
msgstr "Veuillez essayer de créditer votre compte"

#: includes/class-wc-ipaymoney-gateway.php:252
#, php-format
msgid ""
"<strong>%s</strong> is enabled and WooCommerce is not forcing the SSL "
"certificate on your checkout page. Please ensure that you have a valid SSL "
"certificate and that you are <a href=\"%s\">forcing the checkout pages to be "
"secured.</a>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>%s</strong> est activé et WooCommerce ne force pas le certificat SSL "
"sur votre page de paiement Assurez-vous que vous disposez d'un certificat "
"SSL valide et que vous <a href=\"%s\"> forcez la sécurisation des pages de "
"paiement. </a>"

